WEBVTT

00:00:00.569 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:04.270
The treatment is done, and the customer comes to the counter to pay.

00:00:04.553 --> 00:00:09.790
With VaraaAi, you record the payment, and send the invoice, in just a few taps.

00:00:10.058 --> 00:00:10.750
Let me show you.

00:00:11.329 --> 00:00:13.946
First, fill in your invoice details once.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:17.066
Open Settings, and scroll down to Invoice details.

00:00:17.336 --> 00:00:22.666
Enter the company name, company address, business ID, and the VAT rate.

00:00:23.015 --> 00:00:25.626
Then tap Save invoice details.

00:00:26.302 --> 00:00:30.145
When the customer comes to pay, open Bookings, tap their booking,

00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:31.720
and tap Pay at the counter.

00:00:32.246 --> 00:00:33.814
The checkout shows the total.

00:00:33.984 --> 00:00:35.734
You can change the price if you need to.

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:37.334
Choose the payment method:

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:40.214
Cash, Bank transfer, or Gift card.

00:00:40.555 --> 00:00:42.054
You can add a note to the receipt.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.894
Then tap Confirm payment.

00:00:44.423 --> 00:00:47.593
The screen says Payment confirmed, with the invoice number.

00:00:47.862 --> 00:00:50.473
Tap View or download invoice to open it.

00:00:50.727 --> 00:00:54.473
To send it to the customer, enter their email, and tap Send.

00:00:54.665 --> 00:00:56.713
Or tap Show QR code:

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:59.993
the customer scans it, and the invoice opens on their phone.

00:01:00.177 --> 00:01:01.353
Now take the quiz below.
